ا المكتب 75 سم بتصميم بسيط لمساحة العمل."}},"4463":{"factsSha256":"f82709d08418fdf3e4bd45edef352a6776e57895979b00a834e83653cf4c0f44","reviewedAt":"2026-11-12","frames":[{"index":0,"sha256":"beaa5792c5a2fb862740073f352f6a8b96e0f3375712b370ed2d6f0944e5522f","size":[880,880],"crop":[0.1,0,0.8,1],"subjectBounds":[0.25,0.5,0.61,0.41],"tone":"ink","corner":"topRight"},{"index":0,"sha256":"beaa5792c5a2fb862740073f352f6a8b96e0f3375712b370ed2d6f0944e5522f","size":[880,880],"crop":[0.2,0.23,0.6,0.75],"tone":"ink","corner":"topRight","role":"closer-view"}],"copy":{"tr":"Bir sehpayı yanınıza alın, diğerlerini gerektiğinde kullanın. Sora 103’ün üç parçası, işiniz bittiğinde iç içe yerleşir.","en":"Bring one table closer and use the others as needed. The three Sora 103 tables nest together when you have finished.","ru":"Поставьте один столик рядом, а остальные используйте по необходимости. Три столика Sora 103 задвигаются один под другой после использования.","ar":"قرّبوا طاولة واحدة واستخدموا الباقي عند الحاجة. تتداخل طاولات Sora 103 الثلاث معاً بعد الانتهاء."}},"4498":{"factsSha256":"0cd10ca957b6f3901881a40ff68a702ed84562f70a85039e00c035bffd23aa30","reviewedAt":"2026-11-12","frames":[{"index":0,"sha256":"2e245952b324f6d0a7a901a6f772260ff513724a46f6dc0512126b3103e022ee","size":[880,880],"crop":[0.1,0,0.8,1],"subjectBounds":[0.21,0.59,0.51,0.34],"tone":"ink","corner":"topRight"},{"index":0,"sha256":"2e245952b324f6d0a7a901a6f772260ff513724a46f6dc0512126b3103e022ee","size":[880,880],"crop":[0.2,0.23,0.6,0.75],"tone":"ink","corner":"topRight","role":"closer-view"}],"copy":{"tr":"Yatağın yanındaki küçük eşyaları açıkta bırakmadan düzenleyin. Oriella’nın iki çekmecesi, başucunda ayrı bir saklama alanı oluşturur.","en":"Keep bedside essentials organised behind drawer fronts. Oriella has two drawers for storage beside the bed.","ru":"Уберите прикроватные мелочи с открытой поверхности. Два ящика Oriella создают отдельное место для хранения рядом с кроватью.","ar":"رتّبوا الأغراض الصغيرة بجانب السرير بعيداً عن السطح المكشوف. يوفّر درجا Oriella مساحة تخزين قرب السرير."}},"4524":{"factsSha256":"4c362a4a11d7606551e84b5adadf5c9166c8a20fb8cbb6500e839592ba2bc2da","reviewedAt":"2026-11-12","frames":[{"index":0,"sha256":"9cfd41e1f2084c1fee8f64024402bfaccd7b9a234e634d31a3b7d367bd8fcdbd","size":[880,880],"crop":[0.1,0,0.8,1],"subjectBounds":[0.11,0.23,0.72,0.7],"tone":"ink","corner":"topRight"},{"index":0,"sha256":"9cfd41e1f2084c1fee8f64024402bfaccd7b9a234e634d31a3b7d367bd8fcdbd","size":[880,880],"crop":[0.2,0.23,0.6,0.75],"tone":"ink","corner":"topRight","role":"closer-view"}],"copy":{"tr":"Koltuk yanında ya da odanın boş kalan bir köşesinde ek bir oturma yeri. Red puf, 40 × 40 × 40 cm ölçüsüyle yerleşime kolayca dahil olur.","en":"An extra seat beside the sofa or in a spare corner. The Red pouffe measures 40 × 40 × 40 cm for a compact addition to the room.","ru":"Дополнительное место у дивана или в свободном углу комнаты. Размеры пуфа Red — 40 × 40 × 40 см.","ar":"مقعد إضافي بجانب الأريكة أو في زاوية من الغرفة. يأتي بوف Red بمقاس 40 × 40 × 40 سم ليسهل وضعه ضمن ترتيب الغرفة."}},"4538":{"factsSha256":"e3107978c580eab894a18d121462417181759ec98c33135fe3b998c9df0ae6d3","reviewedAt":"2026-11-12","frames":[{"index":0,"sha256":"30ea5fc307d9215cdde7d2f7ff03c7c7ccb1577266f445958fb479568a159fab","size":[880,880],"crop":[0.12,0,0.8,1],"subjectBounds":[0.16,0.34,0.7,0.59],"tone":"ink","corner":"topRight"},{"index":0,"sha256":"30ea5fc307d9215cdde7d2f7ff03c7c7ccb1577266f445958fb479568a159fab","size":[880,880],"crop":[0.22,0.23,0.6,0.75],"tone":"ink","corner":"topRight","role":"closer-view"}],"copy":{"tr":"Masanın üzerini çalışma için bırakın, küçük gereçleri üstteki iki bölmede toplayın. Retria, metal ayakları ve kablo kanalıyla çalışma alanını düzenler.","en":"Leave the desktop for work and keep small essentials in the two upper compartments. Retria combines metal legs with a cable channel.","ru":"Оставьте столешницу для работы, а небольшие вещи разместите в двух верхних